{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"ん〜〜〜〜〜！ななせまる！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どいやさんが北海道に上陸！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがとうございます(^O^)／"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"嬉しい〜！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ななの代わりに、美味しい海鮮をたくさん食べてきておくれ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"新しいデザイン描きたいなー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/nanase.nishino/img/blog/nanase.nishino/img/2013/11/26/6917965/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"マイクロファイバー西野様ですよ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"メンバーを紹介するぜ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/nanase.nishino/img/blog/nanase.nishino/img/2013/11/26/6917965/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ふわふわ飛鳥様に、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"肌ざわり堀様、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"気持ち深川様だ！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"(スタッフさんの素敵ないたずらでした)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"たまに鉄拳さんのパラパラ漫画を観て涙を流します！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"けっこう前、遠征先で一泊するとき、部屋に着いてふぅーって休憩してたらピンポンが鳴る。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちょっと怖いと思いながらも覗いたら、いくちゃん！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「どうしたん？」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「ちょっとなーちゃんに見て欲しいものが〜」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それでいくちゃんの携帯で見たのが、鉄拳さんのパラパラ漫画「振り子」でした。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"その時初